      "message": "Could you please elaborate? I think whenever `mActiveDataSubId` and `mDefaultDataSubId` change, `updateNotificationsNL` will be evoked, so it\u0027s ok if other evocation of `updateNotificationsNL` holds outdated `mActiveDataSubId`/`mDefaultDataSubId`.",
