      "writtenOn": "2023-04-27T04:31:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see ; because you\u0027re running `updateNotificationNL` on that same thread, you know that this thread has released the monitor before any other thread takes it, so any subsequent call will see it. I think it\u0027s fine.",
      "parentUuid": "df5b27f5_39835b39",
